        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR5W4dOvi5YQggXlvWCcQpsHv2OiXtWrfbQxqSLCZc33AtL3aUE8_y0FO1zXlp_5mX-J66DOdrhZpasphDRqduLH9UdOwP1TndgmAXWuNTw9SA5oQMFbz3OeZLQ_LoVEtyuoB06VWvFRgF6Ao-AmBvy2SvBuf-48QqVwryjM2q3WD0K3aGz7BDRDj_PCRSXdjdwsCIoN?fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>The first mile of the line was built in 1897 and was jointly owned by the RGW and the OSL. The OSL served the Provo Woolen Mills factory.<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR7GBh-7AGsitB2d3vInUPuSLA8rqyAc_7ZMZnnqqIOCMDUqoE63RpMTb5Bs9G4AE6Jhyfdozr3W6VPVqajS_zEFwWp_UXQnjoE5FO4-KPLp7flUwVpWbCPdY3I2pusYwby9xaFKYp9cI7wIEu6ZLl_X4S1KFTeO6zyvOIQH_YHyn3ekwfU-cf8WJB5ir9cUjM7yJjk?fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR725Ts5fM3OJYes9fpbB6374lpzhuEH3KrvfNCP8rCCYsbzpafCKTGapDIL8vnMqGEZFv9PqZs2r-6MVAho1PGKCWT23udhs-i-CE2nYGSlRTgTTz0sKtotV1SAo-0Eczu_MUNLZOnM38_Ik08sQb-pFhY4TcE7kzIyaKi04OFNHUl1GxmEXXvMKXtpuO6A-xn1DVTg?fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR6gKjokmsHEVA9B6rs4leNcVRiDWYBmzcW_tIvnZVtAYwqaxOjQA3LyZpoi76RjfxdZq2lbEJySts0zLjPUn1co0DeLAMfHWnHcErM_X_iBH_p6QMvgzxjWpY1Z1akKYdo9M_5fQZKcA6_9y9eWInTGV36Uj7Kl-GuD2WJU4sQjuozhlP51TyzxXFhV8GC_EAfz6ysA?fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
